keywords:
  - pi
  - constructive mathematics
  - irrationality
  - Cauchy reals
  - Rocq
  - formal verification
abstract: >-
  A constructive pi for the constructive Cauchy reals of the Rocq standard
  library, realized by the alternating Leibniz series, with the premise-free
  strong irrationality separation theorems pi_leibniz_strong_irrational and
  pi_leibniz_appart_all_Q: pi is apart from every embedded rational with
  explicit, extractable, runnable witnesses (zero axioms; extracted OCaml
  with zero Obj.magic).
